(fn BEGIN END STR)" t)
(autoload 'grugru-define-on-major-mode "grugru"
"Add new grugru STRINGS-OR-GENERATOR in MAJOR major mode, with GETTER.

MAJOR is `major-mode' or list of that where the grugru is set.
